our vocabulary, get into some twisted, tubing trouble, or hit bullseyes in a peaceful, wooded campground.\n\nAssess your current range of motion and play your way through hundreds of levels that automatically adjust to your movement progress. Complete daily challenges and best your high score.\n\nReach experiences are generally low-impact and are thoughtfully crafted to accommodate restricted range of motion, and are designed to be played for about 20 minutes of daily movement.", "short_description": "Shoulder & upper body mobility games designed to help people move with more confidence. Reach VR fuels shoulder mobility with a library of casual and arcade-style games built with input from shoulder & upper body movement experts."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://reach-vr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://reach-vr.com/terms/", "publisher_name": "Triad Labs", "support_website_url": "http://reach-vr.com/support/", "website_url": "http://reach-vr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "UTILITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "40148086908115704"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974868_3433154236956891_2427367594731674093_n.p